<div itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/FAQPage" class="lh-medium p-3"><h2 class="mb-4">Taiwan Semiconductor Manufacturing Earnings - Frequently Asked Questions</h2><div class="row"><div class="col-lg-6"><dl><div itemscope itemprop="mainEntity" itemtype="https://schema.org/Question" class="faq-item-wrapper">
<dt><div id="question1" itemprop="name text" class="question h3 mt-0 c-dark-blue m-0 border-left b-dark-blue pl-5">When is Taiwan Semiconductor Manufacturing's earnings date?</div></dt>
<dd><div itemprop="acceptedAnswer" itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/Answer" class="answer c-dark-gray pl-5 pt-3 border-left b-dark-gray" style="margin-bottom:2rem;">
<p itemprop="text" id="answer1">Taiwan Semiconductor Manufacturing has not confirmed its next earnings publication date, but the company's estimated earnings date is Thursday, July 18th, 2024 based off last year's report dates. <a href="/stocks/NYSE/TSM/earnings/" class="sr-only sr-only-focusable">Learn more on TSM's earnings history.</a></p>
</div></dd>
</div>
<div itemscope itemprop="mainEntity" itemtype="https://schema.org/Question" class="faq-item-wrapper">
<dt><div id="question2" itemprop="name text" class="question h3 mt-0 c-dark-blue m-0 border-left b-dark-blue pl-5">Did Taiwan Semiconductor Manufacturing beat their earnings estimates last quarter?</div></dt>
<dd><div itemprop="acceptedAnswer" itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/Answer" class="answer c-dark-gray pl-5 pt-3 border-left b-dark-gray" style="margin-bottom:2rem;">
<p itemprop="text" id="answer2">In the previous quarter, Taiwan Semiconductor Manufacturing (NYSE:TSM) reported $1.38 earnings per share (EPS) to beat the analysts' consensus estimate of $1.29 by $0.09. <a href="/stocks/NYSE/TSM/earnings/" class="sr-only sr-only-focusable">Learn more on analysts' earnings estimate vs. TSM's actual earnings.</a></p>
</div></dd>
</div>
</dl></div><div class="col-lg-6"><dl><div itemscope itemprop="mainEntity" itemtype="https://schema.org/Question" class="faq-item-wrapper">
<dt><div id="question3" itemprop="name text" class="question h3 mt-0 c-dark-blue m-0 border-left b-dark-blue pl-5">How much revenue does Taiwan Semiconductor Manufacturing generate each year?</div></dt>
<dd><div itemprop="acceptedAnswer" itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/Answer" class="answer c-dark-gray pl-5 pt-3 border-left b-dark-gray" style="margin-bottom:2rem;">
<p itemprop="text" id="answer3">Taiwan Semiconductor Manufacturing (NYSE:TSM) has a recorded annual revenue of $69.30 billion.</p>
</div></dd>
</div>
<div itemscope itemprop="mainEntity" itemtype="https://schema.org/Question" class="faq-item-wrapper">
<dt><div id="question4" itemprop="name text" class="question h3 mt-0 c-dark-blue m-0 border-left b-dark-blue pl-5">How much profit does Taiwan Semiconductor Manufacturing generate each year?</div></dt>
<dd><div itemprop="acceptedAnswer" itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/Answer" class="answer c-dark-gray pl-5 pt-3 border-left b-dark-gray" style="margin-bottom:2rem;">
<p itemprop="text" id="answer4">Taiwan Semiconductor Manufacturing (NYSE:TSM) has a recorded net income of $27.82 billion. TSM has generated $5.25 earnings per share over the last four quarters. </p>
</div></dd>
</div>
<div itemscope itemprop="mainEntity" itemtype="https://schema.org/Question" class="faq-item-wrapper">
<dt><div id="question5" itemprop="name text" class="question h3 mt-0 c-dark-blue m-0 border-left b-dark-blue pl-5">What is Taiwan Semiconductor Manufacturing's price-to-earnings ratio?</div></dt>
<dd><div itemprop="acceptedAnswer" itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/Answer" class="answer c-dark-gray pl-5 pt-3 border-left b-dark-gray" style="margin-bottom:2rem;">
<p itemprop="text" id="answer5">Taiwan Semiconductor Manufacturing (NYSE:TSM) has a trailing price-to-earnings ratio of 33.11 and a forward price-to-earnings ratio of 28.35. The price/earnings-to-growth ratio is 1.18.</p>
</div></dd>
</div>
<div itemscope itemprop="mainEntity" itemtype="https://schema.org/Question" class="faq-item-wrapper">
<dt><div id="question6" itemprop="name text" class="question h3 mt-0 c-dark-blue m-0 border-left b-dark-blue pl-5">What is Taiwan Semiconductor Manufacturing's EPS forecast for next year?</div></dt>
<dd><div itemprop="acceptedAnswer" itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/Answer" class="answer c-dark-gray pl-5 pt-3 border-left b-dark-gray" style="margin-bottom:2rem;">
<p itemprop="text" id="answer6">Taiwan Semiconductor Manufacturing's earnings are expected to grow from $6.13 per share to $7.68 per share in the next year, which is a 25.29% increase.</p>
</div></dd>
</div>
</dl></div></div></div>
</div>
